72: Journal is append-only: plan + BEGIN -> CLASSIFIED_NOT_APPLIED -> explicit ABORTED, or BEGIN -> DB_COMMITTED_OBSERVED -> DURABLE. Classification is recorded separately from the SQLite decision. DB commit containing the exact idempotency marker is the decision; journal receipt is observation of it. A missing final file cannot authorize replay.
